as another LDN who was born  in Marlay and went through the warrior  program pork was primarily driven by his  loyalty to his fellow warriors and he  shows great emotional attachment to them  and a strong desire to protect them  because of this Porco is especially  shocked at Zeke's betrayal and Porco  desperately wants revenge for what Zeke  and Aaron did in lis burial Porco is  prone to emotional outbursts that can  get the better of him and this has been  exploited by the survey corps in the  past  then we have peak peak is the only known  holder of the card titan power as we  still don't know anything about any of  the past possessors peak also inherited  her Titan power from the male and  warrior program she has demonstrated  exceptional intelligence and she was  given the cart Titan power specifically  because she showed strong judgment peak  has shown incredible skills in battle  despite the fact that her Titan doesn't  have strong offensive capabilities and  she has also shown an immense amount of  dedication to her comrades in the  warrior program peak in her cart Titan  form was the one who managed to save and  retrieve Zeek and Reinert during the  battle of Chicano Peaks intelligence  allows her to see through Marla's  propaganda and in the past she has  voiced veiled criticism of Marla's  policies towards the LD ends and to  their questionable battle strategies  peak recognizes that once modern weapons  rendered Titan powers irrelevant Marlay  and the other nations of the world will  probably try to eradicate all  ldiots as such Peaks motivation is to  find a way to save the ldm people and  end their oppression but she is  conflicted as to how to pursue those  ends she disagrees with Marla's brutal  treatment of LD ins but she also can't  support what Aaron and Zeke did to  Lipari oh and how they were willing to  sacrifice innocent civilians in order to  achieve their goals as of the making of  this video Peaks loyalties lie with her  fellow LD and warriors like Reiner Porco  Gabi and Falco but we are not sure whose  side peak will end up on at the end or  whether she will use her vast  intelligence to come up with a  completely different solution that  defies the wishes of both male and the  Yeager ists then we have the younger  sister of Willi Tiber who was the  shifter who possessed the power of the  Warhammer Titan the Titan that was  passed on within the tiber family for  generations she secretly possessed the  Warhammer Titan power while publicly the  Tiber family claimed that Willie was the  Warhammer Titan we don't know much about  what her motivations were other than the  fact that she was loyal to her family  and that she wanted to defeat Eren she  may really be loyal to Marlay or she may  have been merely protecting the  interests of the Tiber family itself  which is an LD and royal family that  receives special treatment in Marlay  because of the role they played in  bringing down the LD an empire she was  defeated and eaten by Aaron before we  even learned her first name then we have  Zeke Jager and his other quote unquote  father  savor Zeke Jaeger is the son of Grisha  Jaeger and Deena Fritz and Eren Yeager's  older half-brother he was entered into  the Marland Warrior Program by Grisha  who as we know was an LD and  restorationist and wanted to plant his  son as an LD inspire thin the Marlon  military but one day Zeek appeared to  betray his parents and rat them out  along with other LD and restorationist  s-- later in the manga we learned that  Zeke had realized that the Marlon  military was just about to take down the  LD restorationist  and Zeke decided to betray his parents  on the advice of his mentor in the  warrior program Tom's aver if he did  nothing and the Marlon Army inevitably  found out the truth on their own they  would have killed all the restorationist  along with their families including Zeke  and his grandparents the former beast  Titan Tom's a Burt old Zeke that his  parents were cruel to him for putting  him through everything they had put him  through and he specifically told him to  save himself and his grandparents by  betraying Grisha and Deena by betraying  his parents Zeke was able to save  himself and his grandparents and he was  also able to keep the fact that he had  royal blood hidden from the Marley and  military Zeke has the least amount of  time left to live out of the current  Titan shifters and for a time we were  led to believe that Zeke secretly wanted  to save the LD ends and that he and  Aaron were plotting to defeat Marley in  order to end the repression of the LD in  population however in recent chapters we  learned that Zeke apparently wants to  euthanize the entire LDN race his own  race as it appears right now Zeke has a  nihilistic philosophy which holds that  all LD ends by virtue of being able to  transform into Titans are accursed and  they will always be attacked and seen as  evil because of this ability for that  reason Zeke has come to believe that it  would be better for LD ends if they  never even existed and he wants to  ensure that this generation of LD ends  will be the final generation  he hopes to use the founding Titans  ability currently possessed by his  brother Aaron in order to make all LD  ins alive today sterile which would mean  that they cannot produce any more  offspring and the entire LD and race  would die off with this generation this  euthanasia plan was inspired by the  former beast tighten and Zeke's mentor  Tom shaver who also came to believe that  the life of an LVN was nothing but  Xavier was the one who told Zig that the  power of the founding titan allows the  holder not only to manipulate the  memories of all LD ends but also their  physical composition meaning that the  founding titan power could forcibly  sterilized all ldiots xavier also told  Zig that in order to carry out this plan  he would need to work together with  someone who holds the founding Titan but  doesn't possess royal blood because that  is the only way to stop the first Kings  ideology from taking over personally I  completely disagree with this plan and I  hope Zeke doesn't actually go through  with it and I certainly hope that Aaron  will not ultimately support Zeke and  this I understand that the other nations  are afraid of LD ends because of their  ability to turn into Titans but the  individual LD ends alive today are not  responsible for the sins of their  ancestors and they are not at fault for  the fact that they can turn into Titans  I just don't understand how anyone could  possess the amount of self-hatred  required to want to erase their own  people from the world and I am betting  that if not Zeke then at least Eren will  come to his senses and stop this insane  plan from coming to fruition and finally  we also have Armin who unwillingly  became the next colossal Titan after he  ate Bertolt from what I've seen so far  Armand's personality doesn't appear to  have changed that much after becoming  the colossal Titan although he is  definitely willing to kill a large  number of our land soldiers if that's  what he has to do to survive Armin  ultimately wants peace and he doesn't  trust people like Zeke Armin's goal is  to use his intelligence to come up with  a compromise that will allow both LD ins  and other nations of the world to  coexist peacefully anyway let me know  what you guys think who is your favorite  Titan shifter and which of their  motivations can you relate to the most  also how do you think this whole thing  will end is Zeke really going to go  through with his plan and is Eren really  going to go along with it let me know  down in the comments if you enjoyed the  attack on titan content on this channel  and you want to see more leave a like to  let me know and if you're new to anime  uproar don't forget to subscribe and hit  that notification bell a huge thank you  to all of our anime uproar patrons for  supporting our work when I especially 